{"2822770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Faces", "steam_appid": 2822770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Faces is a psychological horror set inside the collapsing mind of Jack Hallow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His decaying apartment serves as the only constant, a place where reality fractures, mirrors are sealed, and something unseen spreads through the walls. Each mirror leads to a memory. Each memory leads to a person from his past. Each person… leads closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive fragments of Jack’s past across distorted locations shaped by guilt, loss, and something far darker. As the apartment shifts and decays, the line between memory and reality begins to collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, the truth behind Jack’s actions is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dead Faces, remembering is either the key to redemption, or the final step towards madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must remember their faces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Selectable Chapters:</strong> Access each chapter through mirrors in Jack’s decaying apartment, each focused on a person from his past and a different location tied to his memories. Uncover the truth behind his fractured mind through psychological madness and hallucinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dynamic Hallucination System:</strong> Experience unpredictable scares as objects morph, spaces distort, and reality bends differently with every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Realism:</strong> Explore realistic atmospheric nightmarish locations from Jack's memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Apartment Hub:</strong> Revisit Jack's everchanging apartment after each chapter as it further decays and twists </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Audio Pooling System:</strong> The game never sounds the same and chooses from a large pool of audio randomly to keep the player paranoid throughout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling:</strong> A story-rich psychological descent with multiple endings told through visual storytelling, dynamic events, and surreal progression instead of traditional objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes:</strong> Themes of Depression, Hallucinations, Suicide, Isolation and a moody nightmarish atmosphere throughout the entire game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Faces is a psychological horror set inside the collapsing mind of Jack Hallow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His decaying apartment serves as the only constant, a place where reality fractures, mirrors are sealed, and something unseen spreads through the walls. Each mirror leads to a memory. Each memory leads to a person from his past. Each person… leads closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive fragments of Jack’s past across distorted locations shaped by guilt, loss, and something far darker. As the apartment shifts and decays, the line between memory and reality begins to collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, the truth behind Jack’s actions is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dead Faces, remembering is either the key to redemption, or the final step towards madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You must remember their faces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Selectable Chapters:</strong> Access each chapter through mirrors in Jack’s decaying apartment, each focused on a person from his past and a different location tied to his memories. Uncover the truth behind his fractured mind through psychological madness and hallucinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dynamic Hallucination System:</strong> Experience unpredictable scares as objects morph, spaces distort, and reality bends differently with every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Realism:</strong> Explore realistic atmospheric nightmarish locations from Jack's memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Apartment Hub:</strong> Revisit Jack's everchanging apartment after each chapter as it further decays and twists </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Audio Pooling System:</strong> The game never sounds the same and chooses from a large pool of audio randomly to keep the player paranoid throughout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling:</strong> A story-rich psychological descent with multiple endings told through visual storytelling, dynamic events, and surreal progression instead of traditional objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes:</strong> Themes of Depression, Hallucinations, Suicide, Isolation and a moody nightmarish atmosphere throughout the entire game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.poster.avif?t=1785549300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.webm?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.mp4?t=1785549300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Dead Faces is a mind bending psychological horror. Unravel Jack's disturbing mind, the faces from his past and the ultimate truth behind his actions. You must remember their faces.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/3595a47d2d01c575de33d61e5d3b48496369ca07/header.jpg?t=1785549300", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/7b1bf7552704a758af31cddb243617f59f850